ass='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja474:9.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja474:9.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja474:10.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja474:10.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja474:10.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja474:10.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja474:10.5": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja474:10.6": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja474:11.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja474:11.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja474:11.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja474:11.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja474:12.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja474:12.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja474:12.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja474:12.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja474:13.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja474:13.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja474:13.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja474:13.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja474:14.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja474:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja474:0.2": "Terasakanipāta ", "ja474:0.3": "Ambavagga ", "ja474:0.4": "1. Ambajātaka ", "ja474:1.1": "“Ahāsi me ambaphalāni pubbe, ", "ja474:1.2": "Aṇūni thūlāni ca brahmacāri; ", "ja474:1.3": "Teheva mantehi na dāni tuyhaṁ, ", "ja474:1.4": "Dumapphalā pātubhavanti brahme”. ", "ja474:2.1": "“Nakkhattayogaṁ paṭimānayāmi, ", "ja474:2.2": "Khaṇaṁ muhuttañca mante na passaṁ; ", "ja474:2.3": "Nakkhattayogañca khaṇañca laddhā, ", "ja474:2.4": "Addhāharissambaphalaṁ pahūtaṁ”. ", "ja474:3.1": "“Nakkhattayogaṁ na pure abhāṇi, ", "ja474:3.2": "Khaṇaṁ muhuttaṁ na pure asaṁsi; ", "ja474:3.3": "Sayaṁ harī ambaphalaṁ pahūtaṁ, ", "ja474:3.4": "Vaṇṇena gandhena rasenupetaṁ. ", "ja474:4.1": "Mantābhijappena pure hi tuyhaṁ, ", "ja474:4.2": "Dumapphalā pātubhavanti brahme; ", "ja474:4.3": "Svājja na pāresi jappampi mantaṁ, ", "ja474:4.4": "Ayaṁ so ko nāma tavajja dhammo”. ", "ja474:5.1": "“Caṇḍālaputto mama sampadāsi, ", "ja474:5.2": "Dhammena mante pakatiñca saṁsi; ", "ja474:5.3": "Mā cassu me pucchito nāmagottaṁ, ", "ja474:5.4": "Guyhittho atthaṁ vijaheyya manto. ", "ja474:6.1": "Sohaṁ janindena janamhi puṭṭho, ", "ja474:6.2": "Makkhābhibhūto alikaṁ abhāṇiṁ; ", "ja474:6.3": "‘Mantā ime brāhmaṇassā’ti micchā, ", "ja474:6.4": "Pahīnamanto kapaṇo rudāmi”. ", "ja474:7.1": "“Eraṇḍā pucimandā vā, ", "ja474:7.2": "atha vā pālibhaddakā; ", "ja474:7.3": "Madhuṁ madhutthiko vinde, ", "ja474:7.4": "so hi tassa dumuttamo. ", "ja474:8.1": "Khattiyā brāhmaṇā vessā, ", "ja474:8.2": "suddā caṇḍālapukkusā; ", "ja474:8.3": "Yamhā dhammaṁ vijāneyya, ", "ja474:8.4": "so hi tassa naruttamo. ", "ja474:9.1": "Imassa daṇḍañca vadhañca datvā, ", "ja474:9.2": "Gale gahetvā khalayātha jammaṁ; ", "ja474:9.3": "Yo uttamatthaṁ kasirena laddhaṁ, ", "ja474:9.4": "Mānātimānena vināsayittha”. ", "ja474:10.1": "“Yathā samaṁ maññamāno pateyya, ", "ja474:10.2": "Sobbhaṁ guhaṁ narakaṁ pūtipādaṁ; ", "ja474:10.3": "Rajjūti vā akkame kaṇhasappaṁ, ", "ja474:10.4": "Andho yathā jotimadhiṭṭhaheyya; ", "ja474:10.5": "Evampi maṁ tvaṁ khalitaṁ sapañña, ", "ja474:10.6": "Pahīnamantassa punappadāhi”. ", "ja474:11.1": "“Dhammena mantaṁ tava sampadāsiṁ, ", "ja474:11.2": "Tuvampi dhammena pariggahesi; ", "ja474:11.3": "Pakatimpi te attamano asaṁsiṁ, ", "ja474:11.4": "Dhamme ṭhitaṁ taṁ na jaheyya manto. ", "ja474:12.1": "Yo bāla mantaṁ kasirena laddhaṁ, ", "ja474:12.2": "Yaṁ dullabhaṁ ajja manussaloke; ", "ja474:12.3": "Kiñcāpi laddhā jīvituṁ appapañño, ", "ja474:12.4": "Vināsayī alikaṁ bhāsamāno. ", "ja474:13.1": "Bālassa mūḷhassa akataññuno ca, ", "ja474:13.2": "Musā bhaṇantassa asaññatassa; ", "ja474:13.3": "Mante mayaṁ tādisake na dema, ", "ja474:13.4": "Kuto mantā gaccha na mayha ruccasī”ti. ", "ja474:14.1": "Ambajātakaṁ paṭhamaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja474:0.1": "", "ja474:0.2": "", "ja474:0.3": "", "ja474:0.4": "", "ja474:1.1": "Ahāsi → āhāsi (?) ", "ja474:1.2": "", "ja474:1.3": "", "ja474:1.4": "", "ja474:2.1": "", "ja474:2.2": "Khaṇaṁ muhuttañca mante na passaṁ → khaṇaṁ muhuttaṁ na maṁ tosayanti (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja474:2.3": "", "ja474:2.4": "Addhāharissambaphalaṁ → athāharissambaphalaṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja474:3.1": "", "ja474:3.2": "", "ja474:3.3": "Sayaṁ harī → athāharī (bj); athāhari (sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja474:3.4": "", "ja474:4.1": "pure hi → pura'ssa (bj, pts-vp-pli1); purepi (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja474:4.2": "", "ja474:4.3": "jappampi mantaṁ → japampi mante (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja474:4.4": "", "ja474:5.1": "", "ja474:5.2": "", "ja474:5.3": "", "ja474:5.4": "atthaṁ → mā taṁ (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) | vijaheyya manto → vijaheyyu mantā (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja474:6.1": "", "ja474:6.2": "", "ja474:6.3": "", "ja474:6.4": "", "ja474:7.1": "", "ja474:7.2": "", "ja474:7.3": "", "ja474:7.4": "", "ja474:8.1": "", "ja474:8.2": "", "ja474:8.3": "", "ja474:8.4": "", "ja474:9.1": "", "ja474:9.2": "khalayātha → balayātha (sya1ed, sya2ed); galayātha (mr) ", "ja474:9.3": "", "ja474:9.4": "", "ja474:10.1": "", "ja474:10.2": "", "ja474:10.3": "", "ja474:10.4": "", "ja474:10.5": "sapañña → sapaññā (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja474:10.6": "punappadāhi → punappasīda (bj, pts-vp-pli1); puna sampadāhi (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja474:11.1": "mantaṁ → mante (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja474:11.2": "Tuvampi dhammena → tvampi dhammeneva (mr) | pariggahesi → paṭiggahesi (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja474:11.3": "", "ja474:11.4": "ṭhitaṁ taṁ → patiṭṭhaṁ (mr) ", "ja474:12.1": "bāla mantaṁ → balamantaṁ (mr) ", "ja474:12.2": "", "ja474:12.3": "Kiñcāpi laddhā jīvituṁ appapañño → kicchā laddhā jīvikaṁ appapañño (bj); kicchā laddhaṁ jīvitaṁ appapañño (sya1ed, sya2ed); kicchāpi laddhā jīvikaṁ appañña (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja474:12.4": "", "ja474:13.1": "", "ja474:13.2": "", "ja474:13.3": "", "ja474:13.4": "", "ja474:14.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja474:0.1": "", "ja474:0.2": "", 